cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Evident
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  # Bibliographic form matches published papers (e.g. MPRA 129330):
  # "Soura Vamseekar, Marti" / website short form "Marti, S. V."
  - family-names: Marti
    given-names: Soura Vamseekar
    email: martisoura@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4884-1292"
abstract: >-
  Evident is an open-source Python library stack for executable governance
  evidence. It converts governance artifacts into an Evidence Graph and
  evaluates deterministic rules to produce explainable, leveled findings
  without issuing legal or regulatory compliance verdicts.
keywords:
  - governance evidence
  - evidence graph
  - model risk
  - auditability
  - python
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SVamseekar/evident"
